          .num_cor
            %h6#corollary Corollary
            %p
              %strong (Dedekind)
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subgroup"} subgroup
              of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+abelian+group"} free abelian group
              is also free abelian.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              The analog of this statement for possibly non-abelian
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groups"} groups
              is the
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nielsen-Schreier+theorem"} Nielsen-Schreier theorem
          %p
