            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+modules"} projective modules
            are
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/retracts"} retracts
            of free modules, we have
          .num_cor
            %h6#corollary_2 Corollary
            %p Projective modules over a pid are free. In particular, submodules of projective modules are projective.
          %h3#SmithNormalForm Normal forms
          #MatricesOverPrincipalIdealDomainsHaveSmithNormalForm.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
